  "mechanism": "FIXED config-B spiking front end (LIF S1->C1, fixed random S2 bank) -> C2 per-template MAX over locations spike code, AVERAGED over G independent LIF glimpses (temporal evidence integration). Readout: a LEARNED SIGNED linear discriminant (supervised three-factor delta = multinomial logistic) SPIKE-PORTED as a POPULATION of LIF class somata driven by EXCITATORY (w+ . r) MINUS FEEDFORWARD-INHIBITORY (w- . r, an interneuron carrying the common mode) drive; spiking WTA over class populations = the fully-spiking prediction. RANDOM arm = identical port, V untrained. Sources: Fremaux & Gerstner 2016; Maass et al. 2002; Brunel et al. 2004; Pouget et al. 2000; Carandini & Heeger 2012.",
